DOU-002 changes (2026-10-19): customs-legal 0.3.0 adds the
overseas-shipment-documents skill preparing the file of an unaccompanied
shipment between metropolitan France and an identified French overseas
territory, in one direction: territorial sheet separating the customs and
tax axes, declared or established operation, item-by-item inventory,
missing documents and questions to the carrier, the territory's customs
service or the local authority. No rate, amount, relief, declaration or
sending. envoi-outre-mer.md 1.0.0 added with readings of 2026-10-19 (Union
Customs Code art. 1 and 4, VAT Directive art. 6, Delegated Regulation
2015/2446 art. 114 and 134, Regulation 1186/2009 art. 25, TFEU art. 349,
355 and Annex II, European Council decisions on Mayotte and
Saint-Barthelemy, Council Decision 2021/991, recodified French Customs Code
as published on 2026-04-11, French tax code art. 294 and 296 and Annex IV
art. 50 octies, Law 2004-639 on dock dues, customs guidance pages).
qualification-douanes.md 1.2.0 and import-document-checklist route overseas
shipments to the new skill.
